            ],
            "body": "- [ ] Which decisions or assumptions deserve a short highlighted attention summary, and what should it surface before someone opens the full plan?\n  - Why it matters: a plan review can be skimmed without the developer understanding a consequential assumption or choice.\n  - Next action: keep this open but non-blocking while the Mermaid-card pilot proceeds. Revisit concise synthetic examples and anonymized Git-history cases when refining the attention summary."
          },
