            "blocks": [
              "m5"
            ],
            "body": "- [x] Which 2D Mermaid view should present branching progress, alternatives and evidence?\n  - Why it matters: the view should make both delivery status and relationships understandable without requiring the reader to reconstruct them from separate documents.\n  - Next action: implement branch-grouped Mermaid cards from normalized relationships; use Plan 066 as the first real map and ask the developer to review the resulting topology and navigation.\n  - Resolution: branch-grouped Mermaid cards are the selected primary presentation. They can show branching, merges, alternatives and dependencies only when those edges are present in adapter data; document order must not imply an edge. No Three.js rendering is part of this pass."
